              "question": "<p>Before making recommendations about how to treat anything, we should know a bit about the underlying conditions, such as the safety issues. What are the main complications that can result from diarrhoea itself?</p>\n"
            },
            "library": "H5P.MultiChoice 1.16",
            "metadata": {
              "contentType": "Multiple Choice",
              "license": "U",
              "title": "Untitled Multiple Choice"
            },
            "subContentId": "0d3d3dfa-a512-45b9-8807-3a1db0a66ea9"
          },
          {
            "params": {
              "media": {
                "disableImageZooming": false
              },
              "answers": [
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>The very young (especially infants)</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>The elderly</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>Actually, it is the obese individuals who are very susceptible to dehydration and electrolyte abnormalities. Adipose tissue (fat) only has 10% water content (compared to about 70% for most other tissues), and that predisposes the overweight individual to the complications of diarrhoea.&nbsp;</div>\n",
                    "tip": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": "<div>Indeed,&nbsp;it is the obese individuals who are very susceptible to dehydration and electrolyte abnormalities. Adipose tissue (fat) only has 10% water content (compared to about 70% for most other tissues), and that predisposes the overweight individual to the complications of diarrhoea.&nbsp;</div>\n"
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Very thin individuals</div>\n"
                }
              ],
              "overallFeedback": [
